5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"To ensure we don't overpromise on operational capacity, I will examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see where the time is actually being lost. I'll look into the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates to see what we can actually afford long-term.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is wise to remember the lessons of the past. I will review the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am interested in the hidden obstacles. I will look into the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
